## Important Learning

One important aspect of this assignment is that the **position of the fields changes after each submission**. Therefore, the automation needs to identify the correct fields dynamically rather than relying only on their fixed screen positions.

## Result

The UiPath automation reads records from the downloaded Excel file and enters them into the RPA Challenge web application one by one. After each record is completed, it clicks **Submit** and continues with the next record until all records are processed.


